os processos enviados à DISA antes da regra atual (sem uso na base DISA: direto à DEPROC). Leia as colunas da esquerda para a direita. Em cada coluna o caminho principal desce reto; os desvios saem para a direita." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="68" width="1600" height="28" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c1043" value="&lt;font face=&quot;Courier New&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;função()&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;o que ela faz&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#555555&quot; style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;chama: &lt;font face=&quot;Courier New&quot;&gt;funções que ela chama&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="114" width="180" height="82" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c1044" value="▶ outra coluna" style="rounded=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;strokeWidth=2;fontStyle=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="250" y="135" width="180" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c1045" value="Pergunta&lt;br&gt;(Sim → direita)" style="rhombus;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="460" y="103" width="180" height="104" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c1046" value="&lt;b&gt;caso&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;variação do fluxo" style="rounded=1;fillColor=#1f4e79;strokeColor=#10314f;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#ffffff;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="670" y="130" width="180" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c1047" value="➕ marcador adicionado" style="shape=hexagon;perimeter=hexagonPerimeter2;size=0.06;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;strokeWidth=2;fontStyle=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="880" y="130" width="180" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c1048" value="➖ marcador removido" style="shape=hexagon;perimeter=hexagonPerimeter2;size=0.06;fillColor=#fff4e5;strokeColor=#d79b00;strokeWidth=2;dashed=1;fontColor=#8a5a00;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1090" y="135" width="180" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c1049" value="📄 &lt;b&gt;Memo&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;no bloco …" style="rounded=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;strokeWidth=2;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1300" y="130" width="180" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c1050" value="📎 relatório PDF anexado" style="shape=document;boundedLbl=1;size=0.15;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;strokeWidth=2;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1510" y="124" width="180" height="62" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c1051" value="&lt;b&gt;Erro&lt;/b&gt; (registrar_erro)" style="rounded=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;strokeWidth=2;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1720" y="135" width="180" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c1052" value="fim / prox_acao" style="rounded=1;arcSize=50;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1930" y="135" width="180" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c425" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:16px&quot;&gt;1 · main() e _processar_linha()&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot;&gt;poetry run task run_geacs_corrige_envio_disa. Um erro nunca interrompe os demais processos&lt;/span&gt;" style="swimlane;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=13;rounded=1;arcSize=1;collapsible=0;container=1;strokeWidth=2;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;swimlaneFillColor=#fbfcfe;startSize=50;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="270" width="718" height="1308" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c408" value="Início" style="rounded=1;arcSize=50;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="c425"><mxGeometry x="24" y="74" width="330" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c409" value="&lt;font face=&quot;Courier New&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;configurar_logging() · ler_processos_a_processar()&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;Cria o log e lê a aba geacs_corrige_envio_disa de processos_a_processar.xlsx e carrega as bases APIS, DISA e MANTIS" style="rounded=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="c425"><mxGeometry x="24" y="142" width="330" height="98" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c407" value="&lt;font face=&quot;Courier New&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;PlanilhaControleGeral() · abrir_sei()&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;Lê a planilha de controle, faz login no SEI e troca para a unidade da GEACS (trocar_unidade)" style="rounded=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="c425"><mxGeometry x="24" y="268" width="330" height="82" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c410" value="&lt;b&gt;Para cada processo&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#999999;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="c425"><mxGeometry x="24" y="378" width="330" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c412" value="acessar_processo():&lt;br&gt;unidade sem acesso?" style="rhombus;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="c425"><mxGeometry x="74" y="446" width="230" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c411" value="registrar_sem_acesso(): prox_acao = Verificar acesso da unidade ao processo, sem ação no SEI" style="rounded=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;strokeWidth=2;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="c425"><mxGeometry x="424" y="473" width="270" height="66" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c414" value="▶ corrigir_envio_disa() — coluna 2" style="rounded=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;strokeWidth=2;fontStyle=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="c425"><mxGeometry x="24" y="594" width="330" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c415" value="&lt;b&gt;Erro levantado?&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Courier New&quot;&gt;registrar_erro()&lt;/font&gt;. Inesperado: + traceback e recarrega a página" style="rounded=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;strokeWidth=2;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="c425"><mxGeometry x="24" y="662" width="330" height="66" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c416" value="&lt;font face=&quot;Courier New&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;controle.registrar()&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;Linha do processo: script, fluxo, prox_acao e erro; colunas memos_disa_n_consta_sei, memos_disa_excluidos_sei, memos_disa_cancelados_sei, memos_disa_nao_excluidos_sei, caso_disa_mantis, relatorios_rp_sei / _rc_sei, memo_deproc_* e corrige_envio_disa (resultado em uma frase)" style="rounded=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="c425"><mxGeometry x="24" y="756" width="330" height="146" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c418" value="Navegador fechado?" style="rhombus;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="c425"><mxGeometry x="74" y="930" width="230" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c417" value="Para o loop (resumo e driver.quit() continuam)" style="rounded=1;arcSize=50;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="c425"><mxGeometry x="424" y="950" width="270" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c421" value="Há mais processos?" style="rhombus;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="c425"><mxGeometry x="74" y="1048" width="230" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c420" value="▶ volta a &quot;Para cada processo&quot;" style="rounded=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;strokeWidth=2;fontStyle=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="c425"><mxGeometry x="424" y="1073" width="270" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c423" value="&lt;font face=&quot;Courier New&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;log_resumo()&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;Fecha o navegador e loga o resumo" style="rounded=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="c425"><mxGeometry x="24" y="1166" width="330" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c424" value="Fim" style="rounded=1;arcSize=50;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="c425"><mxGeometry x="24" y="1244" width="330" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c460" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:16px&quot;&gt;2 · corrigir_envio_disa()&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot;&gt;Troca o memo à DISA &quot;Validar (N Consta)&quot; (uso da RP só no MANTIS) pelo memo DEPROC, como o geacs_inicial faz hoje&lt;/span&gt;" style="swimlane;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=13;rounded=1;arcSize=1;collapsible=0;container=1;strokeWidth=2;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;swimlaneFillColor=#fbfcfe;startSize=66;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="818" y="270" width="718" height="2230" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c426" value="&lt;font face=&quot;Courier New&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;listar_marcadores() · conferir_marcadores()&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;As regras do fluxo inicial" style="rounded=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="c460"><mxGeometry x="24" y="90" width="330" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c428" value="Marcadores inconsistentes?" style="rhombus;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="c460"><mxGeometry x="74" y="168" width="230" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c427" value="&lt;b&gt;MarcadoresInconsistentes&lt;/b&gt;: prox_acao = Verificar marcadores inconsistentes, sem ação" style="rounded=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;strokeWidth=2;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="c460"><mxGeometry x="424" y="180" width="270" height="66" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c431" value="Estado não é um memo à DISA?&lt;br&gt;(01.09 No Bloco ou 01.09.1 Aguarda,&lt;br&gt;os três casos)" style="rhombus;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="c460"><mxGeometry x="74" y="286" width="230" height="152" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c430" value="&lt;b&gt;SemMarcadorDisa&lt;/b&gt;: sem ação" style="rounded=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;strokeWidth=2;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="c460"><mxGeometry x="424" y="342" width="270" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c434" value="Sem Incluir Documento&lt;br&gt;(fechado no setor)?" style="rhombus;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="c460"><mxGeometry x="74" y="466" width="230" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c433" value="&lt;b&gt;ProcessoFechadoNoSetor&lt;/b&gt;: não reabre, sem ação" style="rounded=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;strokeWidth=2;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="c460"><mxGeometry x="424" y="501" width="270" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c436" value="&lt;font face=&quot;Courier New&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;garantir_marcadores_no_sei()&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;O 01.10.B - No Bloco DEPROC: Coparticipação cadastrado" style="rounded=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="c460"><mxGeometry x="24" y="614" width="330" height="66" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c437" value="&lt;font face=&quot;Courier New&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;obter_dados_ui()&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;Último memo da APIS destinado à GEACS: define a rodada" style="rounded=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="c460"><mxGeometry x="24" y="708" width="330" height="66" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c438" value="&lt;font face=&quot;Courier New&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;_memos_disa_n_consta()&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;Memos da GEACS na rodada com &quot;Embora a Planilha BENEFICIÁRIOS ATENDIDOS NA REDE PRÓPRIA (149768791) não indique atendimento para as matrículas relacionadas&quot;" style="rounded=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="c460"><mxGeometry x="24" y="802" width="330" height="98" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c441" value="Nenhum memo?" style="rhombus;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="c460"><mxGeometry x="74" y="928" width="230" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c439" value="Estado N Consta (No Bloco ou Aguarda): retomada (o memo já foi excluído numa passagem anterior); segue" style="rounded=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#999999;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="c460"><mxGeometry x="424" y="940" width="270" height="66" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c440" value="Outro estado: nada a corrigir, sem ação. prox_acao = a do estado (assinar ou aguardar)" style="rounded=1;arcSize=50;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="c460"><mxGeometry x="424" y="1034" width="270" height="66" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c444" value="&lt;font face=&quot;Courier New&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;recalcular_mantis() · avaliar_uso_rede_propria_disa() · relatorios_da_rede()&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;Caso base DISA × MANTIS, como no geacs_inicial, e os relatórios RP / RC da rodada" style="rounded=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="c460"><mxGeometry x="24" y="1116" width="330" height="82" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c446" value="DISA sim, nenhum uso no MANTIS&lt;br&gt;ou relatório faltando?" style="rhombus;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="c460"><mxGeometry x="74" y="1226" width="230" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c445" value="&lt;b&gt;CasoNaoCorrigivel&lt;/b&gt;: sem ação" style="rounded=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;strokeWidth=2;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="c460"><mxGeometry x="424" y="1266" width="270" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c448" value="&lt;font face=&quot;Courier New&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;montar_memo_deproc()&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;MemoDeproc montado &lt;b&gt;antes de qualquer ação no SEI&lt;/b&gt; (cita os RP e RC)" style="rounded=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="c460"><mxGeometry x="24" y="1374" width="330" height="66" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c449" value="&lt;font face=&quot;Courier New&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;excluir_memos_disa()&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;selecionar_doc() · excluir_doc(), do último para o primeiro; relê a árvore até sumirem" style="rounded=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="c460"><mxGeometry x="24" y="1468" width="330" height="66" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c451" value="Algum memo à DISA&lt;br&gt;não excluído?&lt;br&gt;(ex.: assinado)" style="rhombus;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="c460"><mxGeometry x="74" y="1562" width="230" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c450" value="&lt;font face=&quot;Courier New&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;_cancelar_memo_disa()&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;selecionar_doc() · cancelar_doc(), motivo: &quot;O fluxo de apuração da utilização foi alterado, de forma que os processos cujos beneficiários não tiveram utilização na Rede Própria - isto é, não estão contidos na Planilha BENEFICIÁRIOS ATENDIDOS NA REDE PRÓPRIA (149768791) - não deverão passar pela DISA&quot;" style="rounded=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="c460"><mxGeometry x="424" y="1562" width="270" height="178" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c454" value="Algum memo à DISA&lt;br&gt;nem excluído&lt;br&gt;nem cancelado?" style="rhombus;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="c460"><mxGeometry x="74" y="1768" width="230" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c453" value="&lt;b&gt;MemoDisaNaoExcluido&lt;/b&gt;: nada é criado. prox_acao = Verificar o que fazer: memo à DISA (não consta) não excluído" style="rounded=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;strokeWidth=2;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="c460"><mxGeometry x="424" y="1787" width="270" height="82" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c456" value="📄 &lt;b&gt;MemoDeproc&lt;/b&gt; (retomada: já na rodada, pelo assunto, não é recriado)&lt;b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;no bloco 7697744" style="rounded=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;strokeWidth=2;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="c460"><mxGeometry x="24" y="1916" width="330" height="66" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c457" value="➕ 01.10.B - No Bloco DEPROC: Coparticipação" style="shape=hexagon;perimeter=hexagonPerimeter2;size=0.06;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;strokeWidth=2;fontStyle=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="c460"><mxGeometry x="24" y="2010" width="330" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c458" value="➖ 01.09 / 01.09.1 da DISA (estado); o 01 e os informativos ficam" style="shape=hexagon;perimeter=hexagonPerimeter2;size=0.06;fillColor=#fff4e5;strokeColor=#d79b00;strokeWidth=2;dashed=1;fontColor=#8a5a00;whiteSpace=wra